# Keep the Docker build context lean and correct (F34). Host build outputs must never enter the image —
# a Windows-host bin/obj would poison the Linux build — and VCS/tooling/test noise only slows the send.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
.git/
.github/
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
artifacts/
TestResults/
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
# The generated dev database and any local env/secret files must never be baked into an image.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
deploy/compose/.env
# global.json pins the SDK exactly (rollForward: disable, ADR 0002 amendment) for the locked CI restore. The
# image builds use whatever SDK the floating dotnet/sdk:10.0 image ships and restore unlocked, so the pin must
# not reach them or every image build fails the day that image moves to a new patch.
global.json
